  "question": {
    "text": "Which of the following statements are correct for butadiene<br />\r<br />\r<math><mover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mover><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>-</mo><mover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mover><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br />\r<br />\r(1) The <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> bonds are longer than a carbon-carbon double bond.<br />\r<br />\r(2) The <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub></math> bonds are shorter than a carbon-carbon double bond.<br />\r<br />\r(3) The <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> bond is slightly shorter than a carbon-carbon single bond.<br />\r<br />\r(4) The <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> bond is slightly longer than a carbon-carbon double bond.",
